@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

actor User USER_COLOR

box Logic LOGIC_COLOR_T1
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ClientBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":InfoCommandParser" as InfoParser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "command:InfoCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
end box

box Model MODEL_COLOR_T1
participant "model:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "original:Person" as Original MODEL_COLOR
participant "updated:Person" as Updated MODEL_COLOR
end box

box Storage STORAGE_COLOR_T1
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR
end box

User -> Logic : execute("info 1 pr/High ai/-")
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(commandText)
activate Parser
Parser -> InfoParser : parse(arguments)
activate InfoParser
note right of InfoParser
Validate positive index syntax, required financial prefixes,
duplicate/unknown parameters and normal field values.
Build InfoDescriptor with specified flags and nullable values:
omitted field -> preserved; normal value -> replaced; '-' -> cleared.
For this command: priority = High, areaOfInterest = null,
both specified; financialNeed remains unspecified.
end note
create Command
InfoParser -> Command : new InfoCommand(index, descriptor)
note right of Command : Constructor defensively copies the descriptor and its flags.
InfoParser --> Parser : command
deactivate InfoParser
Parser --> Logic : command
deactivate Parser
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
Model --> Command : displayedPersons
note right of Command
Check index against displayedPersons.size(), then select original.
Reject out-of-range indices before constructing or replacing a person.
end note
Command -> Original : getName()
Original --> Command : name
note right of Original
Other getters supply phone, email, relationship, tags,
interaction notes, next action and both contact preferences.
These unrelated fields are preserved.
end note
Command -> Original : getFinancialNeed()
Original --> Command : existingFinancialNeed
create Updated
Command -> Updated : new Person(preserved details, resolved financial fields)
note right of Updated
Financial need preserved, priority replaced with High,
area of interest cleared. All validation and index checks passed.
end note
Command -> Model : setPerson(original, updated)
note right of Model : Observable list updates the PersonCard; the filter remains active.
Command --> Logic : CommandResult
deactivate Command
Logic -> Model : getClientBook()
Model --> Logic : clientBook
Logic -> Storage : saveClientBook(clientBook)
Storage --> Logic
Logic --> User : CommandResult
deactivate Logic
@enduml
